{"id":"nj7c39eiqe700jvwekvu23giw","title":"高等教育普遍采用AI，大学为何难以适应？","originalTitle":"AI use is now universal in higher education. Why are universities failing to adapt?","summary":"大学在应对生成式AI方面进展缓慢，尽管学生普遍使用AI，但截至去年，只有不到五分之一的大学有正式的AI政策。研究发现，大学在评估和课程设计中缺乏结构性变革，AI政策往往模糊不清。全球讨论已转向学生完全依赖AI避免学习的问题，这需要大学培养学生的适应能力，包括批判性思维和独立决策。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-ai-universal-higher-universities.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T21:20:08.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T22:34:57.176Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T22:34:57.176Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":43,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}